{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2e1767e80da1f85e1ec527b3de2c1a3a0797c5c3ca9ab9a03fd4ecd12f4e3de7", "ja": "（とあるオフの日。大きな仕事が終わり、\nその打ち上げを兼ねて、静香と公園にやってきた……）", "zh": "（某个休息日。一项重要工作结束后，顺便庆祝一番，和静香来到了公园……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e8687ec89cffce5eafde4f576c2a811498eff19b6ca90942653db2089911a731", "ja": "ふぅ……。時間を忘れて遊んじゃったな。\n静香、疲れてないか？", "zh": "呼……一不小心就玩到忘了时间。\n静香，你不累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "d079cd6f348d4a4ee0d6731059942dbd0cd253005d42ef17fa273620f705b975", "ja": "これくらい平気です。{$P$}と違って\n普段から鍛えてますから。", "zh": "这点程度没关系。我平时一直都有锻炼，可不像{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8df796d31b3c18cdc2ce26731d27d26b2a095efc30f302327a64d4701445dfda", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。俺は……運動不足を実感したよ。\nボートを漕いだだけで、じわじわ筋肉痛が……くっ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。我……切实感受到自己平时运动不足了。\n只是划了划船，肌肉就逐渐开始酸痛……唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "5982a2c16473f0ae7866510da74300ea42f7daca3cec6d0147dde3f4d977b285", "ja": "ふふっ。確かに、思ったより体力がいりましたね。\nいい運動になって、よかったじゃないですか♪", "zh": "呵呵。确实，比想象中更费体力呢。\n能好好锻炼一下，也算不错了吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "05a5e95764be0a9ba642f46851faef3fcf9d4cffdf01f9275d71734698990b94", "ja": "ボートに乗ることなんて、なかなかありませんから。\nなんだか新鮮で、楽しかったです。", "zh": "毕竟平时很少有机会坐船。\n感觉很新鲜，也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1006_p", "source_sha256": "09250aa743fa95353059084df8cbc8c031cbf715704d14b75493833d8f602729", "ja": "そうだな。楽しんでくれたならよかった。\n……さて、時間も時間だし、そろそろ帰るか？", "zh": "是啊。你能玩得开心就好。\n……好了，时间也不早了，我们差不多该回去了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "10a146797f14d0fd3819b399fd98c444baf0cdaa0a33786ddfc1ed6180124d64", "ja": "えっ？　あ…………そ、そうですね。\n明日も仕事ですし……。", "zh": "诶？啊…………嗯、也是。\n明天还要工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6d7a947b0ad7cecea48551eb2a527804907202ef1f882610953103e0aac3fe83", "ja": "と思ったけど……朝イチの仕事ってわけでもないし、\n少し遊んでくか！　もちろん、静香がよければだけど。", "zh": "本来是这么想的……不过也不是一大早就有工作，\n那就再玩一会儿吧！当然了，静香愿意的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "c6e9be97ff1ae66d5c6aa03751f7a54b0db8b3a3ad15b78617bd9da84ae16381", "ja": "……っ！　ま、まあ……{$P$}が\n遊び足りないって言うなら、付き合ってもいいですよ？", "zh": "……！既然、既然{$P$}都说\n还没玩够的话，我陪陪你也不是不行哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "df088f6c4e0f3168c0a205a450b8b034f115f63a7a9cb894a50d2939e4ed7d89", "ja": "体力にも余裕がありますし……。少し遊んだくらいで\n明日に疲れが残ることもありません！", "zh": "我的体力也还很充沛……。只是玩一会儿的话，明天也不会感到疲惫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f9c4c182028a1608f5234393f5a78931f1c31c405367f4a5d02caea17575380a", "ja": "ぐっ……そ、そうだな。それじゃ、もう少しだけ\n付き合ってくれ。……どこか行きたいところはあるか？", "zh": "呃……确、确实是这样。那就再陪我一会儿吧。……你有没有想去的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "d1fa27662585591b814841f2d0ab05f2513bbda5cab8c92bf5d65f0130b1b71a", "ja": "行きたいところ、ですか？\nボートは乗ったし、他には……あっ！", "zh": "想去的地方，是吗？\n船已经坐过了，其他的……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d4d329b3f70eaec316e16399002d7d92c4a4f648732904888cb6034acd2901e2", "ja": "んっ？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "b5514ed14764f8ac19375e1930300a18a8a98b34682377c34c9314df741c6ba3", "ja": "……実はこの近くに、夜になるとホタルが見られる\n場所があるんです。とても評判みたいで。", "zh": "……其实这附近有个地方，到了晚上就能看到萤火虫。据说评价很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "d4b69ef1b8a8fed2be8059f4f26e838d9b5e4e7449ea0f6a12b7add8cfe35bb7", "ja": "別に、調べたわけじゃないですよ？\n行きたいところを考えた時に、思い出しただけで……。", "zh": "我也不是特意查过哦？\n只是想到想去的地方时，刚好想起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1016_p", "source_sha256": "dafa5498546a8738f1831dc9118355e3bb29822625ac26ba6c782af5b5aae257", "ja": "へえ、ホタルか……。うん、いいじゃないか！\n場所は……静香、わかるか？", "zh": "哦，萤火虫啊……嗯，不错嘛！\n\n地点的话……静香，你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "c856d57a3f25892713709ec0b44b7f6f2776829ce1d206da1889de8550e3231b", "ja": "はい、任せてください！\n行き方はちゃんとメモしてきた～……じゃなくて！", "zh": "好的，交给我吧！\n我已经好好记下怎么走了～……不对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "598d1873ab2f9eebcbcb860ad4f9186f6b0f7505acb4ea028fe27db64158caf9", "ja": "場所は、私がちゃんとわかってますから。\n{$P$}は黙って付いてきてください！", "zh": "地点我很清楚啦。\n{$P$}只要默默跟着我就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0f66e316f8788add484292c6ac5fe910434b81184e2ecd0902515f8662eb858d", "ja": "ああ、わかった。じゃあ、案内は任せるよ。\nあ！　帰りが遅くなるって、ご家族には……。", "zh": "啊，知道了。那带路就交给你了。\n啊！说到回去会晚一些，你家里人那边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "1d57fffcef183a35baba151fda810fd7e8c5e6dccc25dc077cf54a111b6ed3af", "ja": "親には、ちゃんと話してきたので大丈夫です。\n元々、遅くなるつもりでしたし。", "zh": "我已经跟父母说好了，没关系的。\n本来就打算晚点回去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1021_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "b9c377113697e3f1ebfeba10693b7c593d6401257861ad94f22daba7238c46dc", "ja": "早く行きますよ、{$P$}！\n人気スポットで、結構並ぶみたいですから。", "zh": "快点走吧，{$P$}！\n听说那个热门景点要排很久的队。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0404_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0404_1023_p", "source_sha256": "689d1257421fe0dbf3be185fbd3e08d0ae5f333df904341df226a46c772c195e", "ja": "あっ！　待ってくれ、静香！\nうぐっ！？　筋肉痛が……。", "zh": "啊！等等，静香！\n呃！？肌肉酸痛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
